  green, including `count("sh(argv") == 2` — it had counted a comment. Only the end-to-end checks
  bit. test_missingvenv was worse in a different way: its three "the refusal names the lane / says
  NO test ran" checks assert an f-string THE TEST ITSELF wrote, so they proved the test can format
